{"about_the_game":"<strong>Labrys</strong> is a multiplayer (up to 5v1) horror game where one player becomes the minotaur against the human prisoners, trying to escape the randomly generated labyrinth.<br><br>Humans can equip perks and find various equipment to aid them escaping the labyrinth.<br><br>The minotaur has access to various abilities and augmentations to upgrade his abilities.<br><br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2330210/extras/da7c9e24649e80196be69d0657239812.poster.avif?t=1731672204\" width=600 height=180 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2330210/extras/da7c9e24649e80196be69d0657239812.webm?t=1731672204\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2330210/extras/da7c9e24649e80196be69d0657239812.mp4?t=1731672204\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span><br><br><br>\u2022 <strong>Be The Beast</strong><br>You have the opportunity to play as the mighty minotaur, a fearsome creature with great strength and cunning. Kill the humans as they try to escape the labyrinth, using your superior senses and abilities to hunt them one by one. <br><br>Smash through walls and use your abilities to corner your prey. You are the ultimate predator, embrace the power of the minotaur and let the hunt begin!<br><br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2330210/extras/6e47dc0d6e8efbf9c16d11b8e1f38094.poster.avif?t=1731672204\" width=300 height=180 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2330210/extras/6e47dc0d6e8efbf9c16d11b8e1f38094.webm?t=1731672204\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2330210/extras/6e47dc0d6e8efbf9c16d11b8e1f38094.mp4?t=1731672204\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span><br><br>\u2022 <strong>The Ultimate Test Of Survival</strong><br>As a human prisoner, your only goal is to escape the labyrinth before its sealed permanently. Use wits, equipments, agility and the environment to evade the minotaur's wrath. Team with other humans using the voice chat or be selfish to survive. Will you be able to outsmart the minotaur and escape the labyrinth?<br><br>\u2022 <strong>Face The Unknown</strong><br>In Labrys the labyrinth is randomly generated meaning every game is a unique and an unpredictable experience, keeping you on the edge of your seat every time.<br><br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2330210/extras/7b64590f8929ef56c9757da554861c3f.poster.avif?t=1731672204\" width=300 height=180 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2330210/extras/7b64590f8929ef56c9757da554861c3f.webm?t=1731672204\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2330210/extras/7b64590f8929ef56c9757da554861c3f.mp4?t=1731672204\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span><br><br>\u2022 <strong>Single player and Co-op mode</strong><br>Play versus Minotaur AI alone or with your friends!<br><br>\u2022 <strong>Level Progression System and Character Customization</strong><br>Unlock perks and augmentations and character customization options.","background":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/app/2330210?t=1731672204","background_raw":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2330210/page_bg_raw.jpg?t=1731672204","capsule_image":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2330210/capsule_231x87.jpg?t=1731672204","capsule_imagev5":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/st